    "text": "Three particles, each of mass $m$ gram, are situated at the vertices of an equilateral triangle $A B C$ of side $\\ell \\mathrm{~cm}$ (as shown in the figure). The moment of inertia of the system about a line $A X$ perpendicular to $A B$ and in the plane of $A B C$, in gram $-\\mathrm{cm}^2$ units will be\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/bitsat/2za3QMTRGZ5dV8Nb4P_9Rtw3Ka8TeXr4HDIyaJHK_U0.original.fullsize.png\">",
