    "text": "<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/bitsat/lGO2-PSVc5elOdsJMF-jQx9Acl8-LXMD7nj3eFgXusE.original.fullsize.png\"><br>\r\n\r\n$\\mathrm{I}_{\\mathrm{AX}}=\\mathrm{m}(\\mathrm{AB})^{2}+\\mathrm{m}(\\mathrm{OC})^{2}=\\mathrm{m} l^{2}+\\mathrm{m}\\left(l \\cos 60^{\\circ}\\right)^{2}=m l^{2}+\\frac{\\mathrm{m} l^{2}}{4}=\\frac{5}{4} \\mathrm{~m} l^{2}$",
